  "terminal_tree_replacement_lemma": "Let S be the four terminals, T and T' trees on S, and H contain no terminal-terminal edge. If T union H is a forest, every component of H meets S in at most one vertex: otherwise its terminal path plus the T path is a cycle. Consequently T' union H is also a forest."
